Package: xfce4-panel
Version: @DEB_XFCE4PANEL_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: System
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-panel/start
Depends: libglib2.0-0, libgtk-3-0, libxfce4util7, libxfce4ui-2-0, libexo-2-0, libgarcon-1-0, xfconf, libwnck-3-0
Description: Panel for the Xfce desktop environment
 The Xfce panel hosts launchers, a clock, the applications menu, a window
 buttons/tasklist, a pager and a system tray. Ships the panel binary and the
 libxfce4panel-2.0 plugin library plus the bundled plugins.
